            <ArticleTitle>[A new 6,6a-offbenzophenanthridine alkaloid from Macleaya cordata].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>4194-4196</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4268/cjcmm20162218</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new alkaloid was isolated from the leaves of Macleaya cordata with 95% ethanol extracted and its isolation was by column chromatography and preparation HPLC. The new structure was elucidated as 6'-hydroxy-2',3'-dimethoxyarnottianamide on the basis of its spectroscopic date.</AbstractText>
